DTEND:20260601T210000Z
UID:56c87f00fdf280353a8e174b890617b35122026_9:18:18_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:RIT FoodShare
LOCATION:RIT FoodShare (113 Riverknoll), 113 Riverknoll, Rochester, NY 14623, United States
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330052
DESCRIPTION:RIT community members are welcome to stop by the FoodShare Center to receive food, clothing, and personal products at no cost.\n\nThe RIT FoodShare Center is a no questions asked resource, open to any member of the RIT community.  In order to meet the immediate and basic needs of members of the community who are experiencing food insecurity, it is vital that visitors to FoodShare have a need that is otherwise not met.  Community members who can afford to purchase food should allow others to utilize FoodShare services.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330052
END:VEVENT
