DESCRIPTION:Transportation will be provided as we travel to the Rochester Museum and Science Center (RMSC). At the RMSC you'll also find the Planetarium and outdoor gardens to enjoy. We will return to campus by 12pm and you can grab a boxed lunch, to go! This required event counts toward your research hours for the week.\n\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330187
