URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2323396
DESCRIPTION:Student club leaders gather to inform incoming SSP students about clubs and activities they can get involved with at RIT. Breakout rooms will be created with a student club leader in each room. Students will have an opportunity to join rooms they are interested in to ask questions and get more information about the organization. \n\nMeeting Link: https://rit.zoom.us/j/96864787593\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2323396
