CONTACT:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/GoodbyeGoodbuy/rsvp_boot?id=2330381#event_host
CATEGORIES;X-CG-CATEGORY=club_acronym:GOODBYEGOODBUY
CATEGORIES;X-CG-CATEGORY=event_type:University Wide Event
CATEGORIES;X-CG-CATEGORY=event_tags:Sustainability,Community Service
DTSTART:20260814T130000Z
DTEND:20260821T035500Z
UID:10fc75b992f90be0c52231653972dfed6152026_3:46:50_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Goodbye, Goodbuy! Fall Sale Volunteering 2026
LOCATION:RIT Campus - Gene Polisseni Center, 1 Lomb Memorial Dr, Rochester, NY 14623, United States
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330381
DESCRIPTION:About Goodbye, Goodbuy!\nEvery year, RIT students throw out over 100 tons of goods during move-out. The following fall, incoming students purchase the same items. The cycle continues, and usable items sit in landfills. We set out to change this cycle, and reduce waste! Learn more at rit.edu/goodbyegoodbuy.\n\nVolunteer Procedure:\nIf volunteering, please go to the Gene Polisseni Center.\nVolunteers must check in with a Captain. Captains will assign tasks to volunteers based on preferences and needs for the day.\nSafety is our priority! All volunteers are required to wear close-toed shoes. Work gloves and vests will be provided. \nInterpreting services may be requested by volunteers for their shift through myaccess.rit.edu\n\nVolunteer tasks:\nEarly in the week, volunteers will assist with sale set up. Later, they will restock the sale floor, help customers, and assist in making deliveries.\n\nVolunteer Perks:\nIf you volunteer with us on or prior to August 15th, you will also gain access to our exclusive presale, so be on the lookout for that invitation! If you can’t volunteer then, don’t worry - if you volunteer with us on or after August 16th, you will get a $5 voucher that can be used at the sale.\n\nQuestions? Contact ggrit@rit.edu\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330381
END:VEVENT
