SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:SSP Family Welcome Day 2026
LOCATION:SHED (Room 3300), 28 Lomb Memorial Drive, Campus Center, Suite 2720, Rochester, NY ┬ 14623, United States
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2323398
DESCRIPTION:SSP students and families gather for a day of learning and fun. Here's our schedule for the day:\n\n10-11 AM... EDGE Session [Students Only]\n11 AM - 12:30 PM... Family Info Session [Students + Parents]\n12:30-1:30 PM... Break\n\n1:30-2:30 PM... Lunch on Campus [Students Only]\n\n2-2:30 PM... Preview Schedules & Mingle with Upperclass Students [Students Only]\n2:30-3:30 PM... Campus Walkthrough [Students Only]\n3:30-4 PM... Official SSP Sendoff [Students Only]\n\n*Note: Make sure to eat breakfast beforehand. Lunch will be provided for students. \n\n\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2323398
END:VEVENT
