SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Mandatory Immigration Session
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331552
DESCRIPTION:Have questions about your status here in the U.S.? Wondering about full-time course registration and what you need to know to maintain your status. Come sign up for your immigration session and get some crucial and important information of how to maintain your F-1 status during the course of your time here at RIT! This is one of the most important sessions. You'll learn about your visa, immigration rules, and maintaining your status.\n\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331552
END:VEVENT
