UID:c2aa89af3e9bd3695af68caa432eb4d7782026_3:44:57_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:ISS - Parent Lunch 2026
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330622
DESCRIPTION:An exclusive space for parents of international students to connect with the ISS Director, Dr. Megan Kless. Bring your questions and concerns, enjoy a delicious lunch, and gain insights into your student's university experience abroad. Join us for a warm and informative gathering!\n\nStudents may register on behalf of their parents/relatives.\n***This event is for parents and family members only. During this time, new international students will be having lunch with their Peer Advisor Leaders (PALs) at a campus dining location as part of Orientation, so students should not register for or attend the Parent Lunch.***\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330622
END:VEVENT
