UID:e7330378ccb5a47072fb014f9a076cc3832026_2:17:57_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:TigerFest: Tiger TakeOff!
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331356
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we celebrate the start of the semester and continue to welcome our new students with our inaugural Tiger Take Off! This event will include programs and events along the Quarter Mile all throughout the day. Stop by our first day of classes photo booth, taste some treats from the RIT Dining Food Truck, listen to some music from WITR Radio, and get resources from many different departments and programs. There may even be some special guests throughout the day. \n\nTigerFest is RIT’s welcome festival. Start your semester by getting connected and learning about all things RIT! For a complete list of events and sponsors, visit rit.edu/tigerfest. #RITTigerFest\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331356
END:VEVENT
