LOCATION:Monroe Hall - 2060, 28 Lomb Memorial Drive, Campus Center, Suite 2720, Rochester, NY ┬ 14623, United States
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2332121
DESCRIPTION:Need a quiet workspace to do homework and projects? Looking for a space to finish a co-op application? Have a lot of work and don't know where to start? Come to the Co-Work corner M-F 10 - 12pm for a quiet space to do school work. Come alone or with a buddy for some focused work time. Planning materials will be provided to help you make a plan to get your work done. Already have a plan? Great! Stop by to get the work done. \n\nStick around after for Lunch Bunch - a space to eat lunch with friends! \n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2332121
