UID:e20286bcd76bbdaede5a446ce73870ad7232026_2:41:32_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:TigerFest:  Interfaith Origami
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331286
DESCRIPTION:Join us and local origami artist and creator of GamiFold, Sarah Haehn (https://www.gamifold.com), as we work together to produce various origami creations.  Sarah will teach, guide, and provide connection between the art of doing origami with its relationship to wellness, mindfulness, and meaning making.\n\nAdditionally, chaplains will be available from the many Spirituality and Religious Life organizations on campus to answer any questions and learn about what they can offer!\n\nWe hope you can join us as part of the Week of Welcome​​​​​?!\n\nTigerFest is RIT’s welcome festival. Start your semester by getting connected and learning about all things RIT! For a complete list of events and sponsors, visit rit.edu/tigerfest.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331286
END:VEVENT
