SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:TigerFest: Tiger Activities Fair  
LOCATION:Gordon Field House, Rochester Institute of Technology, Tiger Suite- Campus Center, 
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330641
DESCRIPTION:Explore all the ways to get involved at RIT during this year's Tiger Activities Fair! Connect with hundreds of on-campus student clubs and organizations and discover other engagement opportunities. Food truck meals will be available for purchase during the event through RIT Dining. \n\nAll students are welcome to attend!\n\nTigerFest is RIT's welcome festival. Start your semester by getting connected and learning about all things RIT! For a complete list of events and sponsors, visit rit.edu/tigerfest.  \n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330641
