UID:db7198b52d8781e1d18c5981437026e17212026_9:33:09_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Mock Theatre Auditions for the Fall Season
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331238
DESCRIPTION:Audition Workshop on Tuesday, August 25 from 7-9pm in the Panara Theatre (LBJ-1860).\n\nAnxious about auditioning? Want to get the jitters out or simply practice before the actual audition? Come to our audition workshop! Here, you’ll get a sense of how to audition and what the audition will actually be like. You can receive feedback from SPA and NTID theatre and dance faculty. Practice a song selection or a monologue in ASL or English, or participate in the dance workshop! Join us at 7pm in Panara theatre before we split into groups working on these different areas!\n\nComplete this form to participate:\nhttps://forms.gle/nnTRRQF8fqDs1nhC7\n\nFor the audition workshop, please select from the following audition materials. These are the same materials you’ll use for the actual audition:\nView Audition Monologue options (All Theatre Shows): https://docs.google.com/document/d/1NAdxvUpAQNEUIJjJ-eaKDUe-U8tGIvaVezXpr-F6mtU/edit?usp=sharing\nView Audition Song options (For Sunday in the Park with George): https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1v5v11y_G7pcZdlisMrXX0rM5go2DVEAl?usp=sharing\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331238
END:VEVENT
