UID:a03a1323ab849cb2062aea01ddb281b13192026_4:39:15_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:TigerFest: momentum Mixer
LOCATION:Duda Plaza/Gene Polisseni Center, 35 Lomb Memorial Dr., Rochester, NY 14623, United States
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2327214
DESCRIPTION:Meet other aspiring leaders and the Center for Leadership & Civic Engagement team in Duda Plaza (outside Gene Polisseni) to learn more about the momentum: leadership development program!! \n\nThe momentum mixer will feature the division's key leadership experiences such as Residence Advisor, Orientation Leaders, Club & Greek E-Board Members, and more while participants enjoy food, giveaways, games, and networking. \n\nStart your journey with us by registering for the momentum series, a portfolio of programs designed to introduce you to the core competencies needed to step into leadership roles on campus and in the Rochester community. You'll start with momentum I, RIT's leadership launchpad that will introduce you to key student leader roles on campus while helping you develop meaningful leadership competencies! Come hungry and with questions for us to answer. \n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2327214
END:VEVENT
