UID:081a6d851af6a1462110ad4c875a51268122026_2:29:47_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:TigerFest: Bow Wow Wellness
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331669
DESCRIPTION:Having a ruff day? Come see your your favorite furry friends are back! Stop by the Fireside Lounge to de-stress with therapy dogs. If you're missing your fur family at home, come hang out with these pups and take a break to feel refreshed and relaxed.\n\nDuring this event, you may observe photographers or videographers from the RIT Student Life, Marketing, and Communication team. Their role is to assist in documenting the dynamic and engaging programs we offer. Given that many of our events emphasize self-care and we are considerate of the students participating, we do not permit filming or photography for personal use, class projects, or similar purposes.\n\nTigerFest is RIT’s welcome festival. Start your semester by getting connected and learning about all things RIT! For a complete list of events and sponsors, visit rit.edu/tigerfest.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331669
END:VEVENT
