DESCRIPTION:Summer isn’t over yet! There’s still Tiger Scouts left! Bring a friend (or find one here) and relive camp, making friendship bracelets, painting rocks and much more! Sit by the campfire and toast some s'mores, washing them down with drinks from our very own Tiki Bar! Don’t miss the fun and collect badges for activities you complete!\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331448
