UID:6f64ba86cdddeb3117c97ced99615a6e8122026_3:43:54_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:RIT Dance Collective Auditions
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331678
DESCRIPTION:The RIT Dance Collective is held within the School of Performing Arts. The company is comprised of 3 genres of dance - Hip-Hop (coordinated by Julia Nguyen), Ballet (coordinated by Katherine Duffy, from Rochester City Ballet), and Modern/Contemporary Dance (coordinated by Christopher Ryan). This dance company will perform at various campus events as well as off campus performances. The Dance Collective is open to students by audition.\n\nStudents should arrive 30 mins before the section(s) they want to audition for to fill out forms/grab numbers. No preparation required. Students will warm up, learn phrases/combos and perform them in groups.\n\nModern/Contemporary Dance auditions - 3:30pm\nBallet auditions - 5:00pm\nHip Hop auditions - 6:30pm\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331678
END:VEVENT
