UID:11d7272a6bbd703540d12ac307bd75537132026_4:02:27_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Intramural Free Agent Night 
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330639
DESCRIPTION:Looking to play Intramurals but don't have a team? We've got you covered!\n\nJoin the Intramural Sports staff for an evening of free drop-in, pick-up games featuring soccer, volleyball, and basketball in the Student Life Center and Gordon Field House. Whether you come with friends or show up on your own, you'll have the chance to play, meet other students, and connect with people who are looking to form or join teams.\n\nOur staff will be on hand throughout the evening to help you find teammates, answer questions, and register you for an Intramural league on the spot.\n\nAlready have a team? Come out anyway! It's a great chance to get some extra playing time, meet new people, and kick off the semester with some friendly competition.\n\nNo registration required, just show up and play!\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330639
END:VEVENT
