URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331412
DESCRIPTION:New to intramurals? Looking for a team? Drop-in and play a variety of sports with other free agents. Sign-up today!!\n\nPlease come dressed ready to participate in any or all of the sports offered.  The evening will give students an opportunity to meet new people and play small sided games of volleyball, soccer, and basketball.  \n\nTigerFest is RIT’s welcome festival. Start your semester by getting connected and learning about all things RIT!\nFor a complete list of events and sponsors, visit rit.edu/tigerfest. \n\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331412
