UID:2a9b9cc6d376c7b9b728585c9bba375a7152026_11:58:30_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Chamber Music (Small Group Performance) Information Session
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330646
DESCRIPTION:Learn more about Chamber Music at RIT. \n\nPRFL 288 (Small Group Performance): This course involves rehearsing and performing in small performance groups in music, theatre and dance. Groups may include flute choir, saxophone quartet, horn ensemble, woodwind or brass ensembles, theatre groups engaged in devised or classical theatre, dance groups, or mixed instrument or vocal groups. Ideas about as well as the application of collaboration and/or improvisation will be emphasized. Students will be led by a faculty member and will rehearse weekly. Collaborative practice in rehearsals and performances will also be discussed and applied within the context of the students’ major(s). Instructor approval required.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330646
END:VEVENT
