UID:bf00d62e97300f573f203eb816a62d82842026_11:39:56_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:TigerFest: Greek Day
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331415
DESCRIPTION:Interested in learning more about fraternity and sorority life at RIT? Stop by Greek Day on Greek Lawn during TigerFest and meet members from RIT's fraternities and sororities all in one place!\n\nExplore chapter tables, learn about leadership, service, philanthropy, academic support, and social opportunities, and find out what makes each organization unique. Whether you're actively looking to join or simply curious about Greek Life, this is a great chance to ask questions, make connections, and learn about upcoming recruitment and intake opportunities.\n\nOpen to all RIT students, Greek Day is the perfect way to kick off the fall semester and discover how you can get involved in the Greek community.\n\nTigerFest is RIT's campus-wide celebration of community, tradition, and Tiger spirit. Explore events, make connections, and discover new opportunities throughout the first week of classes. For a complete list of events and sponsors, visit rit.edu/tigerfest. #RITTigerFest\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331415
END:VEVENT
