UID:05d58915a6c4defe04bfc41a20bca5b1842026_9:43:26_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Tiger Fest: Take a Pause with Health Promotion!
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331413
DESCRIPTION:Come take a pause from your busy first week with the Wellness Peer Educators, and try some low-key wellness strategies! Health Promotion offers a variety of programming to promote the wellness of RIT students, and we’d love to meet you! Join us for some hands-on activities, learn about the office, how to stay up to date on our events, and how you can join the team as a student employee! \n\nTigerFest is RIT’s welcome festival. Start your semester by getting connected and learning about all things RIT! For a complete list of events and sponsors, visit rit.edu/tigerfest.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331413
END:VEVENT
