UID:33d366e3a628c0a3796f646b7c421af68242026_9:32:44_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Greek Convocation
LOCATION:Ingle Auditorium, 34 Lomb Memorial Drive, 04-A510, , Rochester, NY 14623, United States
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2334166
DESCRIPTION:Come learn more about important upcoming events, changes to FSL, and more to best support your chapter this academic year!\n\nWe will also have a keynote speaker! Michelle Guobadia from the Hart Agency will be joining us to deliver her award winning keynote: Get in Control!: Your Role in Making Fraternity and Sorority Life Great!\n\nSo, now that you’re in a fraternity or sorority, life is great, right? But have you ever stopped to consider how your role in your chapter is making it truly great? Or worse, could your behavior be destroying it? \n\nIn her typical candid style, Michelle provides a wake-up call to those fraternity and sorority members who are coasting on their status or who are senselessly participating in destructive behavior, like hazing, abusive drinking, assault and poor academics.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2334166
END:VEVENT
