UID:a261a39462fabd29efa7c2f467feb9da6222026_12:21:07_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:TigerFest: Lighting the Way
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330408
DESCRIPTION:Be part of the tradition that connects RIT women and nonbinary students: past, present, and future!\n\nJoin us for this annual RIT tradition of over 20 years, a lantern march through campus welcoming incoming women and nonbinary students. Participants will receive a commemorative lantern with a piece of advice or encouragement from a former student. This year's theme is honoring our history while embracing our future. \n\nThis event will begin with an opening ceremony in the Davis Room (SAU 1300), followed by a lantern march through campus, with a reception to follow in the University Gallery (Booth Hall 2700). All RIT community members are welcome. Please register to request interpreters or accommodations. \n\nEvent Overview:\nThursday, August 27th\n7:30pm: welcoming ceremony - Davis Room (SAU 1300)\n8pm: lantern march through campus\n8:30pm: reception - University Gallery (Booth Hall 2700)\n\nTigerFest is RIT’s welcome festival. Start your semester by getting connected and learning about all things RIT!\nFor a complete list of events and sponsors, visit rit.edu/tigerfest. \n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330408
END:VEVENT
