UID:29af15ee8e9f9e4dcbc2beccde1ebefe7282026_3:01:39_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Technical Theatre Opportunities
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331329
DESCRIPTION:Ever wondered what goes on behind the curtain? Whether you want to be involved with lighting, build sets, manage stage operations, or master sound, RIT School of Performing Arts and NTID Department of Performing Arts want YOU on our crew!\n\nJoin us for an information session to discover upcoming technical theatre opportunities, meet fellow theatre makers, and learn how to get involved in our productions this year.\n\nWhile this event is open to every student interested in backstage production, priority assignment for specific production roles and design positions will be given to students currently enrolled in Technical Theatre Pathways, Theatre Ensemble, and Theatre Practicum Courses. Don't worry if you aren't enrolled yet—come to the session to learn how you can participate.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331329
END:VEVENT
