UID:64d895b4863093bb3764af30189cef9f7292026_10:09:33_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:The Mix Up
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331334
DESCRIPTION:Mix it up and get social! All RIT students, new and returning, are welcome to stop by for fun activities, free food and drinks, and a live DJ hosted by the Division of Access, Engagement, and Success. This is your chance to kick off the semester by meeting new people, repping your regional or state pride, and picking up some free swag. Play games, win prizes, and connect with others! You’ll also have the opportunity to celebrate the diverse cultures represented here at RIT through regional snacks or learning new languages, or impress others with your dance skills with House and Techno music. \n\nInterpreters have been requested.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331334
END:VEVENT
