UID:b5aa49acf8037e05cb154312bc1c38147242026_9:41:43_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:The Planets: Gods of the Cosmos Dance Auditions
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331288
DESCRIPTION:RIT and NTID Performing Arts are excited to announce dance auditions for the following production:\nThe Planets: Gods of the Cosmos\n\nDance auditions will take place on Thursday, August 27 and Friday, August 28 in the NTID Dance Lab 1 & 2 (LBJ-1845 & 1825). Interpreters will be provided. \n\n6-6:30pm: Registration at Dance Lab\n6:30-8pm: Teaching dance routine\n8-10pm: Working dance routine\n\nComplete an audition form prior to arriving at auditions: https://forms.gle/nQEwgQExGkqHvY7s9 \n\nIf you have questions, please reach out to one of the directors. Their contact information will be found in the drop down menu below.\n\nIf you have questions, please email Marc, mehnpa@rit.edu.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331288
END:VEVENT
