UID:059d2d1beb6759bd74192d5cbd8875898122026_2:26:03_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:TigerFest: Into the ROC- Public Market Bus 
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331668
DESCRIPTION:Take a free ride to downtown Rochester and discover the Rochester Public Market! Shop for fresh produce, ethnic delicacies, and much more! The bus will run on a loop picking students up, and dropping students off, every hour at the Sentinel Statue.\n\nBus Schedule -\n\nThe bus will leave from RIT at the following times:\n10:00 AM\n11:00 AM\n12:00 PM\n1:00 PM (FINAL PICK UP TIME)\n\nThe bus will leave from the Rochester Public Market at the following times:\n10:30 AM\n11:30 AM\n12:30 PM\n1:30 PM\n2:30 PM (FINAL DEPARTURE TIME)\n\nTigerFest is RIT’s welcome festival. Start your semester by getting connected and learning about all things RIT! For a complete list of events and sponsors, visit rit.edu/tigerfest.\n\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331668
END:VEVENT
