UID:8e03b06deb03651823c7210f014fcc48872026_1:18:00_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Into the ROC: Flower City Pickers
LOCATION:Rochester Public Market
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331569
DESCRIPTION:Join Into the ROC at the Rochester Public Market as we support Flower City Pickers' mission of feeding people, not landfills. Volunteers will help sort, distribute, and deliver food to those who need it most. \n\nFree transportation will be provided. You can take the Public Market Bus if you would like to go early to explore. Van transportation is also available and will depart from the Sentinel Statue promptly at 1:30pm! Please be sure to dress appropriately for the weather (comfortable clothes that can get dirty and closed toed shoes!) and bring a water bottle.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331569
END:VEVENT
