SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:RIT Pagan Weekly Gathering
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2332539
DESCRIPTION:Standard educational meeting on a particular religion, spirituality, culture, or way of life. Weekly meetings are usually lecture or discussion based but may include demonstrations or hands on activities. \n\nA schedule of topics can be found in the club's shared google drive, and announcements will always be posted in Discord: access here at https://discord.gg/uBnMC2AW2z. If you don't have discord, weekly emails will be sent out through campus groups. Please be mindful that we may have last minute cancellations or schedule changes.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2332539
END:VEVENT
