URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2175702
DESCRIPTION:For students who are just starting to think about study abroad, don't have a program in mind already, and are looking to learn the basics about types of programs RIT offers, how to find a good program fit, how to fund study abroad, etc.\n\nMonday Study Abroad 101 meetings take place every week in person at the RIT Global office from 11:00 am to Noon . Use the registration link to sign up for a meeting time. The RIT Global Office is located in Global Village, Bldg. 400, Room 2075, 2nd floor above the Patio (take the outdoor stairs to the 2nd floor above the Patio restaurant)\n\nIf you need Access Services support, request at myaccess.rit.edu\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2175702
END:VEVENT
