LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2332432
DESCRIPTION:Kick off the new academic year with the Future Stewards Program for an evening of pizza, trivia, and prizes. Meet other Indigenous students, reconnect with friends, and learn more about FSP resources and opportunities for the year ahead.\n\nTrivia winners will receive prizes from Tuscarora Woodworks, a Native-owned business. Food will include pizza, wings, and a gluten-free option.\n\nCome hungry, bring your trivia skills, and help us start the semester together.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2332432
END:VEVENT
