UID:c2a9286a24b2a49c2099c96e6c36fab38242026_10:35:52_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Pit Auditions - Sunday in the Park with George
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2334172
DESCRIPTION:SUNDAY IN THE PARK WITH GEORGE\nMusic and Lyrics by Stephen Sondheim\nBook by James Lapine\n\nRIT Performing Arts Center\nNovember 12-15, 2026\n\nDirector: Prof. Christopher Ryan\nMusic Director: Prof. Dane Noble-Rosema\nRIT School of Performing Arts\n\nAUDITIONS: Saturday, 9/5/26 between 4:30 - 7:30 PM\nRehearsal Studio, RIT Performing Arts Center\n\nAudition Sign Up: https://www.signupgenius.com/go/10C0B4BA5A82AA2F9C34-65307362-sunday\nComplete the Conflict Form: https://forms.gle/JvHZwbTSb3ruGZfA9\n\nSeeking the following Musicians (Audition Cuts Coming Soon!):\n(2x) Violin 1\n(2x) Violin 2\n(2x) Viola\nCello\nBass / Acoustic Bass\nFlute 1\nFlute 2 / Piccolo\nOboe\nEnglish Horn\nClarinet 1\nClarinet 2\nClarinet 3\nBass Clarinet\nAlto Saxophone\nFrench Horn\nTrumpet\nTrombone\nPercussion 1 (Drum Set)\nPercussion 2 (Auxiliary)\nPercussion 3 (Mallets)\nKeyboard 2 (Ancillary)\n\nSunday in the Park with George Pit Ensemble\nRehearsal & Performance Schedule\n\nMusic Rehearsals\nPAC Rehearsal Studio, unless otherwise noted\n\nThursday, 10/15/26 @ 5 - 7:30 PM*\nTuesday, 10/20/26 @ 5 - 7:30 PM*\nThursday, 10/22/26 @ 5 - 7:30 PM*\nTuesday, 10/27/26 @ 5 - 7:30 PM*\nThursday, 10/29/26 @ 5 - 7:30 PM*\nTuesday, 11/3/26 @ 5 - 7:30 PM - within PAC Orchestra Pit\n* = On these 5 rehearsals, students registered in PRFL-282 (Concert Band) will be released by 6:15 PM, as needed\n\nSitzprobe (First Pit Ensemble Rehearsal w/ Cast, Seated)\n\nWednesday, 11/4/26 @ 6 - 8:30 PM (Sitzprobe in First Half of 6:30pm Rehearsal only)\nTech Rehearsal & Wandelprobe (Pit Ensemble Rehearsal w/ Cast, Moving Onstage)\n\nFriday, 11/6/26 @ 6 - 8:30 PM (Wandelprobe in First Half of 6:30pm Rehearsal only)\nOrchestra Dress Rehearsals\n\nTuesday, 11/10/26 @ 7 - 11 PM Musicians Call (7:30 PM Downbeat)\nWednesday, 11/11/26 @ 7 - 11 PM Musicians Call (7:30 PM Downbeat)\nPerformances\n\nThursday, 11/12/26 @ 7 PM Musicians Call (7:30 PM Downbeat)\nFriday, 11/13/26 @ 7 PM Musicians Call (7:30 PM Downbeat)\nSaturday, 11/14/26 @ 7 PM Musicians Call (7:30 PM Downbeat)\nSunday, 11/15/26 @ 7 PM Musicians Call (7:30 PM Downbeat)\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2334172
END:VEVENT
