UID:f419f25c6ec189519238850d3b0dc0e63192026_4:07:02_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:momentum I: Leadership Development Program (Track A)
LOCATION:CPC-2610/2650 Bamboo Rooms, 35 Lomb Memorial Dr., Rochester, NY 14623, United States
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2327203
DESCRIPTION:Momentum I is RIT's centralized leadership launchpad to introduce students to meaningful competency development and to increase their sense of belonging through connections to key leadership opportunities including Orientation Leaders, Residence Advisors, and Wellness Peer Educators.\n\nDuring session I, we will address the power of self-awareness and how it relates to a number of key leadership experiences in the Center for Leadership and Civic Engagement. Come prepared to do a deep dive into some of your strengths and areas of growth.\n\nPlease visit myaccess.rit.edu in advance to request services. Please register for the remaining sessions below.\n\nFood will be provided for each of the sessions.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2327203
END:VEVENT
