UID:5f67c6983db3472d634870596a7fc9fe5262026_3:42:03_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:FirstByte Donut Days: Quick Connect with Academic Success Center (ASC), Liangxiao Zhu Tutoring Center, & Center for Experience and Growth (EDGE)
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330218
DESCRIPTION:Donut Days is a re-occurring event featuring a rotating list of guests from within and outside GCCIS. It focuses on awareness and access to important resources. Stop by the Donut Days table at your convenience to ask questions of the representatives!\n\nThe Academic Success Center (ASC) has many resources to support you including time management toolkits, tutoring services, and study strategies. The GCCIS Tutoring Center offers academic support from peer-tutors for all GCCIS introductory courses. At EDGE: Center for Experience and Growth, our services are designed to help you excel by providing the tools, techniques, and support you need. Grab a donut and learn more!\n\nAssorted Donuts and a gf/vegan snack option to be provided. First-Come First-Served\n\n**Should you need sign language interpretation services, please complete the request here. \n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330218
END:VEVENT
