UID:3c2182f7fa08b65d857831d335c53be68272026_9:35:28_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Campus Connect: Puzzle with the Profs
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2336134
DESCRIPTION:Math getting hard? Good—that means you’re actually learning. No one gets it right on the first try, so come take a breather and recharge at Puzzles with the Profs! This isn't a lecture, and there is zero calculus required. It’s a low-pressure hang out designed to help you build your academic bench for the semester. Drop in to play giant Jenga, play games, grab free food, and hear professors share their own hilarious "faculty fail" stories from when they were in your shoes.\n\nWhy You Should Be There:\n\n• Free Food & Games: Kick back with giant Jenga, board games, and great snacks.\n• Faculty Fail Stories: Hear your math profs spill the real, unedited truth about the times they completely bombed a test or didn't know how they were going to pass a class.\n• Build Your Support Bench: Mistakes are expected in college, but knowing who has your back makes all the difference. Meet the people who can help when you hit a wall:\n\nYour Professors (Math 111 and Math 171)\nRecitation Leaders & ASC Math Support Tutors\nSaturday Morning Math Academy Crew\nClassmates who are in the exact same boat\nCome as you are, bring your mistakes, and leave with a solid game plan for the term.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2336134
END:VEVENT
