UID:43ab5068fc415430c804ae2296be70cc782026_11:02:11_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:NSPM Special Edition: Co-Op Connections
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330598
DESCRIPTION:Co-Op Connections offers a supportive drop-in space where students can share their experiences, get guidance from peers and professionals, and access helpful resources. We’re here to help you manage stress, feel validated, and navigate your co-op journey with confidence.\n\nThis special edition of Co-op Connections will acknowledge the observance of National Suicide Prevention Month, explore how compounding stressors can contribute to increased mental health challenges and will reinforce how connecting with supports, like Co-op Connections, can reduce risk of suicide. \n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330598
END:VEVENT
