DESCRIPTION:Join the CLCE and Residence Life for a Campus Connect program. We will be partnering with the Free Art Collective to create art that will be distributed to community members at local events. Let your creativity shine and help put a smile on your neighbor's face by creating knick-knacks, decorating bags, and sharing words of wisdom!\n\n✨ All artistic abilities welcome!\n🖍️ Decorate mini canvases, craft small items, and/or make zines\n🤝 Support mental wellness through creativity and service\n\nCome be part of something meaningful and make a positive impact, one piece of art at a time.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330660
