LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2336135
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a low-pressure way to hang out, meet new people, and score some prizes? Drop in for a high-energy game night hosted by CES! Whether you’re a first-year, first-generation student, or just looking to unwind, everyone is welcome to step up to the buzzers or cheer from the crowd.\nOur live Family Feud rounds feature quick, rotating teams so you can show up anytime, jump right into the game, and walk away with awesome prizes.\nWhat to Expect:\n\n• Free Food & Drinks: Fuel up with a walking taco bar and refreshing mocktail margaritas provided by Campus Connect..\n• Prizes & Swag: Play rounds to score prizes and CES swag.\n• Great Energy & Connections: Vibe to background tunes and chat with CES First-Gen mentors who are on-site to hang out and answer questions about campus life..\n• Accessible Fun: DHH interpreters will be present for the event to ensure everyone can get in on the action..\nNo need to bring a pre-made team—just drop in, grab a taco, and join the game whenever you're ready!\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2336135
END:VEVENT
