DESCRIPTION:The Community Service Fair brings together the RIT and Greater Rochester communities to provide an opportunity for students, faculty, and staff to meet representatives from various local community-based organizations and learn how they can make an impact in their time at RIT. Over 40 community-based organizations will be in attendance and are looking to connect with students interested in volunteering. Find Your Greater Good with the Community Service Fair!\n\n*Complete a bingo board to earn a Java's token!\n\nASL interpreters will be available.\n\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330217
