LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2334293
DESCRIPTION:Game Night: (But make it afternoon!)\n\nDid you know that RIT/NTID have communication supports that are FREE to all students led by practicing speech language pathologists? Groups include:\n-Conversation Group\n-Focus Flow and Thrive (Executive Functioning)\n-Unique Minds (Neurodivergent Community and Support)\n-Gender Affirming Voice Groups\n\nCome join us in LBJ (aka NTID) and see if groups are right for you. Worst case scenario: you get free snacks and meet some new students! \n\nAll modalities welcome (ASL, spoken English, sim com, etc). Group leaders will match communication needs of the group, interpreting has been requested.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2334293
END:VEVENT
