LOCATION:Campus Center Breezeway, 35 Lomb Memorial Dr., Rochester, NY 14623, United States
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2332110
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate National Voter Registration Day with ROAR the Vote!  Are you planning to cast your ballot this election?  If you are, Roar the Vote is here to help!  We are here to help you register to vote, request an absentee ballot, provide free stamps and printing for voting-related needs, and more!  You've got questions...we've got the resources.\n\nGo to rit.turbovote.org if you can't make it to the table to register to vote, request an absentee ballot, and more.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2332110
END:VEVENT
