UID:f43f7e50d25b4b2c4ee9df4ead677a4f8172026_1:01:37_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Resume Review & Mock Interviews with WE@RIT sponsor L3Harris
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2332141
DESCRIPTION:Did you realize that Career Fair is fast approaching (9/23)? Wouldn't it be great to get some low-stakes resume and/or interview assistance from those already in the engineering field?  WE@RIT has just the thing!\n\nOn Tuesday, September 15th, from 5-6:40pm, L3Harris will have representatives on campus for resume reviews and mock interviews with the WE@RIT community. Students can sign up for a specific time slot for a resume review and/or a mock interview; or students are welcome to drop in anytime during the event for mock interview workshopping with L3Harris representatives and fellow students.  WE@RIT has done the work of compiling common interview questions and will have them available for students at the interview workshopping area.  We will also do our best to accommodate walk-in's for one-on-one resume reviews and mock-interviews space permitting.  It is still wise and strongly encouraged to sign up for a scheduled timeslot to ensure your time with an L3 Harris representative if you would like a one-on-one review or interview.  \n\nNote that one-on-one resume reviews and mock interviews each require a separate time slot.  Resumes are due to the WE@RIT office on Friday, 9/11 by 9am (email: we@rit.edu) for those opting for a resume review. No resume is needed if doing a mock interview. Dress is business casual, and those partaking in a Resume Review should come prepared with a printed out copy of their resume (in addition to emailing it to WE@RIT (we@rit.edu) by 9/11 at 9am. (Printing services will not be available at the event). Resume Reviews and Mock Interviews each require a separate 20-minute slot. See registration sheet for more details. \n\nDeaf/HOH Students: if you need an ASL interpreter, please submit an Access Services Request.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2332141
END:VEVENT
