SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:ROAR the Vote:  Constitution Day
LOCATION:Fireside Lounge, Student Alumni Union (SAU), 35 Lomb Memorial Dr., Rochester, NY 14623, United States
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2332111
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the United States Constitution and join in on a reading marathon! Join us in the Fireside Lounge to read books on voting, civic engagement, and history, as well as the US Constitution itself. Free books and pocket constitutions will be provided to attendees, and you are also welcome to bring your own. Drop in for ten minutes, or come by for two hours -- we just ask that you show up when you can and keep the reading streak going! Free cookies, and snacks will be provided. Let's get reading!\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2332111
END:VEVENT
