LOCATION:St. Mark's and St. John's
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2333180
DESCRIPTION:Join Into the ROC as we work in St. Mark's and St. John's Community Gardens. These gardens produce food to be distributed to community members at St. Mark's and St. John's on site food pantry.\n\nFree transportation will be provided. The bus will depart from the Sentinel Statue promptly at 9:30am! Please be sure to dress appropriately for the weather (comfortable clothes that can get dirty and closed toed shoes!) and bring a water bottle. Work gloves will be provided.\n\nFallFest is RIT’s annual celebration of fall fun! Join us for all kinds of activities, including games, food, entertainment, and more. For a complete list of events, visit rit.edu/FallFest. #RITFallFest\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2333180
