UID:8851773a1e911ef862a6b4483e4a90f18172026_1:19:01_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:STEM Affinity Expo with WE@RIT
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2332142
DESCRIPTION:The STEM Affinity Expo (formerly the Affinity Reception) is a reverse career fair, where employers visit representatives of student groups the evening ahead of spring career fair. To represent WE@RIT, students must be co-op or full-time eligible (2nd-5th year students), in a KGCOE engineering major, and identify as part of the WE@RIT Community. Prior participation with WE@RIT is strongly desired, as company representatives are likely to ask you about the organization and your participation within it. Spots are limited to half-hour timeslots, and anyone wishing to represent WE@RIT must attend a mandatory event training, and upload their resume to the event's resume book (further instructions on each will be sent to all registrants). Professional dress is required. If spots remain after interested parties have signed up for one half-hour slot, a representative from WE@RIT will reach out to fill any remaining spots. \n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2332142
END:VEVENT
