UID:07c872d7a0d101a233f00b5ada04fb6e8172026_1:24:27_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:WE@RIT's Mocktails with MOOG
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2332143
DESCRIPTION:Mix and mingle with representatives from MOOG and WE@RIT over mocktails and charcuterie.  This event is open to anyone in KGCOE, will be far less formal than the career fair (come as you are), and appropriate to attend whether co-op or full-time eligible or just wanting to practice networking in a low-stakes environment over light snacks. \n\nDeaf/Hard of Hearing Students needing ASL interpretation should submit an Access Services Request. \n\nAbout MOOG: TL;DR: MOOG designs any system that moves (especially) on planes. \n\nFrom MOOG: Our engineers have developed the capability to design and manufacture the most advanced motion control products for aerospace, defense, industrial and medical applications – applications where precise control of velocity, force, acceleration and fluid flow are critical. Our motion control portfolio has expanded to include all forms of actuation technology, sophisticated control electronics and system software. MOOG hires the following engineering majors: Mechanical, Electrical, Computer, Microelectronic, Industrial, Biomedical & Software; & predominantly US citizens (defense contractor).\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2332143
END:VEVENT
