SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:ROAR the Vote:  Your First Vote with Campus Connect
LOCATION:Douglass Sprague Perry Hall Lobby and Sol Heumann Hall Lobby, 35 Lomb Memorial Dr., Rochester, NY 14623, United States
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2332113
DESCRIPTION:Will this be your first time voting in a local, state, or national election?  Stop by the DSP or Sol Heumann Lobbies to learn about how you can register to vote, request an absentee ballot, learn how to review the ballot of candidates, and make a plan to vote!  ROAR the Vote volunteers and the Voter Advocacy Network will be there to help you navigate Your First Vote!  I\n\nGo to rit.turbovote.org if you can't make it to the table to register to vote, request an absentee ballot, and more.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2332113
END:VEVENT
