UID:a7a36b7bb39209f0c7859dae95c1c7ed792026_2:07:02_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:NSPM Special Edition: Transitions and Connections: Fall 2026
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330627
DESCRIPTION:A welcoming space for trans and nonbinary students to meet new folks, engage in fun activities, and have supportive discussions. Each week features community building and exploration of diverse topics relevant to trans and nonbinary students. Access services available upon request.\n\nThis special edition of Transitions and Connections will recognize National Suicide Prevention Month. The discussion will highlight the unique mental health challenges that trans and non-binary students may experience and acknowledge the increased risk of suicide that can result from these challenges. It will also emphasize how meaningful connections to supportive resources, like Transitions and Connections, can help foster well-being and reduce suicide risk.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330627
END:VEVENT
