UID:521e542e7ef41d3340fb00cd9878b5906242026_10:37:30_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Empowerment Expo: Campus and Community Resources for Women and Nonbinary Students
LOCATION:Fireside Lounge, Campus Center, Second Floor, Suite 2010, Rochester, NY 14623, United States
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330415
DESCRIPTION:Join the Women, Gender, and Sexuality Resource Center in Fireside Lounge on Monday, September 28th from 11am-1pm for our Empowerment Expo, featuring campus and community resources for women and nonbinary students. Connect with clubs and organizations on campus, and find support and community at RIT and beyond!\n\nPrevious participating organizations have included: \nThe Women, Gender, and Sexuality Resource Center\nWomen's, Gender, and Sexuality Studies Program\nTitle IX and RESTORE\nThe National Organization for Women's Campus Action Network at RIT\nWomen in Engineering \nWomen in Technology \nWomen in Computing\nWomen of Excellence Supporting STEM\nHer Campus\nWomen in Weightlifting \nWomen's Rugby Club\nHot Wheelz\nWomen's Advisory Council \n\nAll RIT students are welcome. Please register to request interpreters and other accommodations. \n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330415
END:VEVENT
