DESCRIPTION:As part of FirstByte's Ask Me Anything series, join us for a panel discussion about the RIT experience with 3rd-, 4th-, and 5th-year students from the RIT College of Computing. \n\nStudents on the panel range in major, experience, and interests, providing a wide variety of insight to answer your questions about college.\n\n**Should you need sign language interpretation services, please complete the request here. \n\nThere will be pizza on a First-come First Served basis with some dietary options. \n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330229
END:VEVENT
