DESCRIPTION:Take a free ride downtown and shop for fresh produce, ethnic delicacies, and much more! No RSVP required, bus is first come, first serve until max capacity on the bus is reached!\n\nGetting There:\nPick up from Grace Watson Hall at 10:30 a.m. \nPick up from Kate Gleason Circle at 10:45 a.m.\n\nComing Back:\nLeave Rochester Public Market District at 12:30 p.m. \nReturn to the Rochester Institute of Technology at 1 p.m. \n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2336178
