UID:5d59543dff507826c8536ebb1afc09204202026_3:08:17_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Into the ROC: Genesee Country Village & Museum Agricultural Fair 
LOCATION:Genesee Country Village and Museum
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2328554
DESCRIPTION:Join Into the ROC for Genesee Country Village & Museum's Agricultural Fair!\n\nCelebrate the bountiful Western NY harvest as the Museum shines in its finest fall colors! Enjoy livestock and cooking demonstrations, entertainment for the whole family, and browsing for unique finds at the market in the tradition of the country fairs. Visit the historic village, art museum, and nature center. Explore exhibitions in more than 150 categories of judged baked goods, preserves, hand-made needlecrafts, photography, and 19th-century industrial arts. \n\nThere will be two buses for this event, which will be on rotation every half hour. The first bus will leave promptly from the Sentinel Statue at 10am. The admission fee is waived for all RIT students. \n\nBus 1:\n9:45AM: Arrive at RIT Sentinel Statue\n10:00AM: Depart from RIT Sentinel Statue\n"10:30AM: Drop off at GCV&M\n1410 Flint Hill Road, Mumford, NY 14511"\n11:00AM: Pick up/Drop off at RIT\n11:30AM: Pick up/Drop off at GCV&M\n12:00PM: Pick up/Drop off at RIT\n12:30PM: Pick up/Drop off at GCV&M\n1:00PM: Pick up/Drop off at RIT\n1:30PM: Pick up/Drop off at GCV&M\n2:00PM: Pick up/Drop off at RIT\n2:30PM: Pick up/Drop off at GCV&M\n3:00PM: Drop off only at RIT\n3:30PM: Pick up only at GCV&M\n4:00PM: FINAL drop off at RIT\n\nBus 2:\n10:15AM: Arrive at RIT Sentinel Statue\n10:30AM: Depart from RIT Sentinel Statue\n"11:00AM: Drop off at GCV&M\n1410 Flint Hill Road, Mumford, NY 14511"\n11:30AM: Pick up/Drop off at RIT\n12:00PM: Pick up/Drop off at GCV&M\n12:30PM: Pick up/Drop off at RIT\n1:00PM: Pick up/Drop off at GCV&M\n1:30PM: Pick up/Drop off at RIT\n2:00PM: Pick up/Drop off at GCV&M\n2:30PM: Pick up/Drop off at RIT\n3:00PM: Pick up/Drop off at GCV&M\n3:30PM: Drop off only at RIT\n4:00PM: Pick up only at GCV&M\n4:30PM: FINAL drop off at RIT\n\n\n\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2328554
END:VEVENT
