URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2334294
DESCRIPTION:In this virtual training CLCE will demonstrate the ins and outs of how to input and submit your community service hours properly. The meeting is being held on Zoom. Attendance will be tracked and will be utilized in each chapter's Expectations of Excellence (EOE) report. \n\nPresident, VP, Philanthropy Chair, and Community Service Chair required to attend attended Community Service Tracking Training - Meets \nRequired positions and 25% of chapter required to attended Community Service Tracking Training - Exceeds\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2334294
END:VEVENT
