SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Roar and Soar Donut Days: Quick Connect with Academic Success Center (ASC), Tutoring, EDGE: Center for Experience and Growth
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2332751
DESCRIPTION:The Kate Gleason College of Engineering's Donut Days is a recurring event featuring a rotating lineup of guests from within and outside KGCOE, focused on connecting first-year engineering students with important campus resources. Stop by the Donut Days table anytime to grab information and ask the guests your questions.\n\nThis session, learn more about the Academic Success Center (ASC), tutoring, and EDGE: Center for Experience and Growth at RIT.\n\nAssorted donuts and a gluten-free/vegan snack option will be provided - first-come, first-served while supplies last.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2332751
END:VEVENT
