UID:e125785dee4729cd3a9de0627fab1611722026_2:19:39_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Immersion and Minor Fair
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330498
DESCRIPTION:The annual Immersion & Minor Fair is Wednesday, October 7, 2026 in the SAU-Fireside Lounge. This is a great time to gather more information on your immersion, minor and double major options. \n\nTalk with advisors and sign up for your immersion and/or minor on the spot.\n\nFREE pizza (while it lasts)\nDoor prizes for the first 50 students in line\nWe hope to see you there!\n\nTo request an interpreter, please visit myAccess.rit.edu.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330498
END:VEVENT
