UID:b50a3b2aac98b779eb91d0ba9c1b59438212026_9:21:31_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:"How It Works" - Accelerated Scholars (Combined Accelerated Bachelor's / Master's Degrees) ZOOM
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2333175
DESCRIPTION:As a new Accelerated Scholar, we invite you to attend an information session to learn more about the Combined Accelerated Bachelor's/Master's degree program. This session provides an opportunity to connect with fellow scholars, gain important information about the program, and have your questions answered by the Combined Accelerated Programs team.\n\nWe'll cover the support services and resources available to you, how credits can be double-counted or waived toward your graduate degree, and how to access and review the conditional requirements for your master's program. We'll also discuss financial aid considerations at the graduate level and what to expect as an Accelerated Scholar at RIT.\n\nAccess services may requested at https://myaccess.rit.edu/\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2333175
END:VEVENT
