UID:4c12045e582bc021fa33605dd351ee746232026_2:22:44_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Banned Books Week: Book Bedazzling
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330414
DESCRIPTION:Presented by the Women, Gender, and Sexuality Resource Center and the Division of Access, Engagement, and Success: \nBanned Books Week - Book Bedazzling\n\nOut of the 3,743 unique titles banned last year, a recent PEN America report found: \n44 percent of titles featured characters or people of color\n39 percent featured LGBTQ+ characters or people\n\n- Bedazzle a FREE copy of a banned book\n- Bring questions for our panel of bookish professionals\n- Learn action steps you can take today\n\nWednesday, October 7th\n 6-8pm\nPRISM (Campus Center 2050)\n\nRegister to request an interpreter or other accommodations. All RIT students are welcome!\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330414
END:VEVENT
