SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:ROAR the Vote:  Absentee Voting Party
LOCATION:Fireside Lounge, Student Alumni Union (SAU), 35 Lomb Memorial Dr., Rochester, NY 14623, United States
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2332135
DESCRIPTION:Are you looking to request an absentee ballot?  Do you already have your ballot and want to cast it (but in a fun way)?  Wondering what an absentee ballot is?  ROAR the Vote has got your back!  Free stamps, envelopes, printing and paper will be provided, alongside yummy snacks!  A notary will be present, too, in case you need your ballot notarized with an official.  We can't wait to see you there.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2332135
END:VEVENT
