UID:4bda074a99703f9e5f8cc8cff7ef39098242026_2:52:52_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Unique Minds: Connection, Community, and Support
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2334284
DESCRIPTION:This group is intended for anyone who feels like their brains might work differently than others around them, who are neurodivergent or question if they may be, or who have a known or suspected diagnosis (e.g. Autism, ADHD, OCD, Anxiety, Depression, etc)\n\nThis group is led by a neurodivergent SLP. Our goals are to make connections, build community, have fun, and learn ways to support ourselves. Discussion, activities, and games.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2334284
END:VEVENT
