UID:8e182f0218017d9b0888f09c5869d8e36242026_1:16:52_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Susan B. Anthony Museum & House
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330416
DESCRIPTION:Visit Susan B. Anthony Museum & House with the Women, Gender, and Sexuality Resource Center!\n\nTour the historic house where women’s rights activist Susan B. Anthony was arrested for voting, and visit the 1872 cafe.\n\nFriday, October 23rd \nBus leaves from the Sentinel at 11:30am and returns at 2:30pm\n\nStudents will be split into two groups and spend one hour at the museum and one hour at the cafe. Bus transportation and tickets for the museum are provided. Students are responsible for their own cafe purchases. All RIT students are welcome! Please register to request an interpreter or other accommodations.\n\nREGISTRATION REQUIRED - SPACE IS LIMITED!\n\nhttps://susanb.org/\nhttps://1872-cafe.com/\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330416
END:VEVENT
