UID:2eff48e886d968728ed5d86a5bda6206692026_2:26:44_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Into the ROC: Friends of Washington Grove
LOCATION:Washington Grove Park
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330362
DESCRIPTION:Volunteer with the Friends of Washington Grove as we work to remove invasive species and perform basic trail maintenance in Rochester's old growth forest! You will be given the opportunity to tour the area with a guide before trail maintenance begins.\n\nFree transportation will be provided. The bus will depart from the Sentinel Statue promptly at 9am! Please be sure to dress appropriately for the weather (comfortable clothes that can get dirty and closed toed shoes!) and bring a water bottle. Work gloves will be provided.\n\nIn case of severe weather (thunderstorm, windstorm, ice storm, etc.) you will get an email from the Into the ROC team regarding rescheduling the event. In this case, a rain date for this event is scheduled on Sunday, October 25 from 9am-1pm.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330362
END:VEVENT
