UID:716c0f57ead98f9fd96f55068066870a612026_8:53:38_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:2026 FirstByte Failing Forward: Workshop on Building Resiliency
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330240
DESCRIPTION:Resilience means being able to cope with tough times. When something bad happens, you still feel anger, grief, and pain but you're able to bounce back and keep going.\n\nAt this workshop, you'll learn how to deal with challenges and how to move on after setbacks with the College of Computing's embedded mental health counselor, Elizabeth Mammarello. \n\nFood provided: first-come, first-served. Vegan and Gluten-free options available upon request\n\nRegistration is preferred but not required.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330240
END:VEVENT
