DESCRIPTION:We will celebrate student voting on Election Day! Students may stop by to pick up an "I Voted" sticker, connect with fellow voters, and join ROAR the Vote in recognizing the importance of civic participation. Whether they have already voted, are heading to the polls, or voted by mail, all students are welcome to stop by and be part of this campus-wide celebration of democratic engagement.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2332112
