UID:ade62be47e088be926cec84e9fb1e7958242026_2:36:18_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Focus, Flow, and Thrive: Strategies and Supports
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2334271
DESCRIPTION:Do you feel like you need some extra help with finding ways to improve attention, planning, time management, or other "executive functioning" skills? \n\nThis group is led by a speech language pathologist. We will meet weekly to discuss areas of challenges and work together to develop supports and strategies that work for you. \n\nAll modalities are welcome (spoken English, ASL, sim com). Open to both Deaf and hearing students. \n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2334271
END:VEVENT
