UID:fca0fd855e44af0864ae31d7b7465b37492026_10:12:12_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:FoodShare: Wegmans East Avenue Grocery Run
LOCATION:Third Presbyterian Church, 4 Meigs Street, Rochester 14607, United States
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2328244
DESCRIPTION:Join Team RIT FoodShare for the upcoming Wegmans East Avenue Grocery Run!  Upon registering for our team, your entire registration fee will be donated to RIT FoodShare as we work to combat food insecurity on our campus.  Please register for the event here, and then follow this link,https://www.groceryrun.org/ to complete your official race registration!\n\nIf registered before October 6th, all registrants will receive a free t-shirt. \n\nThere are 4 options for racing this year: \n5K - $32.80 (run or walk)\n10K - $43.40 (run only)\n1K- $27.50\nVirtual- $32.80\n\nPlease note:  prices increase after September 30, 2026.\n\n***Note: Registering on CampusGroups does not automatically register you for the race. You will have to pay the registration fee when completing your sign-up through the East Avenue Grocery Run website\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2328244
END:VEVENT
