SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Into the ROC: AIDS Remembrance Garden
LOCATION:Beikirch Park
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331337
DESCRIPTION:Join Into the ROC as we work with other local colleges and universities to help restore and renovate Rochester's AIDS Remembrance Garden in Beikirch Park.\n\nA bus will leave promptly from the Sentinel Statue at 9:30am. Please dress accordingly for working in the outdoors -- closed toe shoes, a rain jacket, and long pants are highly encouraged. Please bring water and a light snack if you need!\n\nIf you have any questions, please reach out to Victoria Cirillo at vrcrli@rit.edu.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331337
END:VEVENT
