DESCRIPTION:RIT community members are welcome to stop by the FoodShare Center to receive food, clothing, and personal products at no cost.\n\nThe RIT FoodShare Center is a no questions asked resource, open to any member of the RIT community.  In order to meet the immediate and basic needs of members of the community who are experiencing food insecurity, it is vital that visitors to FoodShare have a need that is otherwise not met.  Community members who can afford to purchase food should allow others to utilize FoodShare services.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2334083
