DESCRIPTION:Stop by for a donut and to learn about resources offered by the Study Abroad Office and RIT Dining\n\nDonut Days is a re-occurring event featuring a rotating list of guests from within and outside GCCIS. It focuses on awareness and access to important resources. Stop by the Donut Days table at your convenience to ask questions of the representatives!\n\nAssorted Donuts and a gf/vegan snack option will be provided. First-Come First-Served\n\n**Should you need sign language interpretation services, please complete the request here. \n\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330246
