UID:dbdbddca9099f4d24e4ac8c523100a7d7272026_2:09:17_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:On Campus Service Project: Giving Tuesday's Hunger Project
LOCATION:Gordon Field House and Activities Center, 35 Lomb Memorial Dr., Rochester, NY 14623, United States
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331300
DESCRIPTION:Join in on RIT's annual Giving Tuesday event on Tuesday, November 17th.  300 RIT volunteers will be teaming up with US Hunger to package and prepare 30,000 nutritious meals for RIT FoodShare & Rochester's FoodLink. \n\nWith music booming, lentils flying, and a sea of orange hairnets, volunteers will work together to create a truly dynamic experience...and the by-product? Healthy meals packaged for hungry community members along the way.\n\nYou can register as part of a student organization, chapter, or department OR you can register as an individual!  We  welcome all of the RIT community!\n\nShifts times are:  \n11 a.m. - Noon\n12:30 - 1:30 p.m.\n2 - 3 p.m.\n\nPlease note:  If you do not have access to register in CampusGroups, please contact Bill St. Jean at brsrla@rit.edu to register.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331300
END:VEVENT
