UID:8bdd8a90c9cdc855f8170f6ec411736a612026_10:55:55_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:2026 FirstByte Transgender Day of Remembrance
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330252
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a meaningful evening of reflection, support, and solidarity at our annual Transgender Day of Remembrance (TDOR) event. TDOR is a solemn occasion dedicated to honoring the lives of transgender and gender-diverse individuals who have lost their lives due to violence and transphobia. This event aims to raise awareness about the violence faced by transgender individuals and to foster a safe, inclusive community committed to advocacy, allyship, and change.\n\nThere will be a couple of tables out to create your own paper lanterns with tea light candles to remember and honor those who have lost their lives in the Rochester area. There will be other crafts, a small treat, and informational hand outs available at this event. This event is first come, first served. \n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330252
END:VEVENT
