UID:a42660de72d7c85b4a239e352e7498b38282026_9:57:24_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Bern's Closet
LOCATION:RIT FoodShare (113 Riverknoll), 113 Riverknoll, Rochester, NY 14623, United States
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2336590
DESCRIPTION:Bern's Closet, located at the RIT FoodShare Center, is a free clothing resource for the RIT community focusing on clothing for employment and job interviews with a mix of business casual and formal clothes.  We also offer winter clothing including coats, hats, scarfs, gloves, and boots, as available.  Clothes are donated by members of the RIT and Rochester communities.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2336590
END:VEVENT
