UID:84bd4c41ab124a02e49850247b03406f8122026_4:00:30_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:momentum II: Leadership for Social Change
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331680
DESCRIPTION:Develop the skills to lead change with intention and purpose. Through the Social Change Model of Leadership Development, explore self-awareness, collaboration, shared purpose, and civic responsibility. You’ll have opportunities to reflect on your own leadership and practice skills for working with others to create meaningful change.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331680
END:VEVENT
