UID:da8db356f487891ff70ce8b1d74d3ef37222026_2:13:03_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Red Cross Student Blood Drive:  February Drive
LOCATION:Student Alumni Union (SAU) 1829 Room, 35 Lomb Memorial Dr., Rochester, NY 14623, United States
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331268
DESCRIPTION:Join the CLCE for our February Blood Drive! Our goal is to collect 59 units from the RIT community to help meet the Red Cross' critical need.  It is highly recommended to schedule your appointment in advance and complete the Red Cross registration online at:  https://www.redcrossblood.org/give.html/drive-results?zipSponsor=ritstudentrochester \n \nYou don't need a special reason to give blood. You just need your own reason. Some of us give blood because we were asked by a friend. Some know that a family member or a friend might need blood some day. Some believe it is the right thing to do. Some do it for the free cookies and juice. Everyone enjoys the great feeling of helping save lives!\n\nIf you are unsure if you are eligible to give blood - check out the Red Cross Website: https://www.redcrossblood.org/give.html/drive-results?zipSponsor=ritstudentrochester \n\n\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331268
END:VEVENT
