URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2333252
DESCRIPTION:This is our weekly event where everyone in Cru comes together. Large Group is a way for students to connect with other students on campus,  we like to say we are a caring group passionate about connecting people to Jesus Christ. \nJoin us every Friday for some worship, fellowship, a short message, and a fun event afterwards. \n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2333252
END:VEVENT
