SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:momentum II: Allyship & Belonging
LOCATION:Campus Center - PRISM, 35 Lomb Memorial Dr., Rochester, NY 14623, United States
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331661
DESCRIPTION:momentum II develops the leadership skills needed to create communities where others feel valued, included, and empowered. Centered on allyship, collaboration, and belonging, this experience will help student leaders build greater awareness of diverse perspectives, strengthen inclusive leadership practices, and foster meaningful connections within their organizations and communities.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2331661
END:VEVENT
